         CRUISING:
         • Shift-W or three-triangle icon under FREE FLIGHT in the top-center of your screen – activates or deactivates your cruise engines.
         
         Cruise engines provide a good way to get somewhere quickly, but you cannot fire your weapons when they are charging up or engaged.

