S 23000  MISSION 6
S 23005  OBJECTIVE:
         Defeat Hovis in a one-lap contest of speed. Then find Quintaine and bring him to Planet Leeds to help Sinclair and Juni with the artifact.
         
         DIFFICULTY:
         Unknown. Hovis seems confident of his abilities.
         
         REWARD:
         Critical information about the artifact.

S 23006  OBJECTIVE:
         Find Quintaine and bring him to Planet Leeds to help Sinclair and Juni with the artifact.
         
         DIFFICULTY:
         Quintaine may be in a non-combat vessel and must survive the journey. You must be alert. Obviously, you are not the only person trying to find him.
         
         REWARD:
         Critical information about the artifact.

S 23010  The race is one lap around the oval-shaped course. The course is twenty-two gates long; the final gate is the same as the first gate.
         
         You must fly through the gates in the proper direction.
         
         Using your cruise engines is strongly recommended.

