         You have to return the Proteus Tome to Juni. Fly back to Kyoto Base with Lord Hakkera as quickly as possible.
         
         DIFFICULTY:
         With Tekagi dead and a large portion of his forces defeated your escape should be less difficult than getting in. Resistance is expected to be sporadic and light.
         
         REWARD:
         The Proteus Tome – the very reason why you came to Kusari.

