S 24830  \nHold down the left mouse button to turn. Right-click to fire. Use W to accelerate and S to slow down. You can also press the Space Bar to toggle mouse-look turning.
S 24835  \nStop and wait for King to activate the Trade Lane. Hold down the S key to slow down.
S 24840  \nFly toward the Waypoint (purple diamond), which marks the entrance to the Trade Lane to Fort Bush. Use W to accelerate and Shift-W to cruise.

S 24850  \nSelect the USV Brandt and then click the FORMATION icon at the top of your screen.

S 24870  \nSelect the planet’s docking ring. Then click the DOCK maneuver at the top of your screen. The waypoint (purple diamond) is currently marking the docking ring.
S 24875  \nClick on any part of the Trade Lane ring in space. Then click the DOCK maneuver icon in the Neural Net at the top of your screen.

